      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Half-life is how long it takes for about half of the caffeine to leave your body. It's estimated for you from your age, health conditions and the factors you've entered, using published research. All amounts in this app are estimates.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 18,
