          "startingColumn": 18,
          "startingLine": 123
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Heart rate, sleep, height and weight are read and analyzed on this iPhone only. To fully remove access, open the Health app → Sharing → Apps → Last Can.",
